igrate to Romanía, which was ﬂourishing economically. The empire was now crisscrossed by denser Jewish networks that extended throughout the eastern Mediterranean and into Muslim-ruled lands. Overall, these Jewish communities appear to have ﬂourished too."'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 862, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 787})
