t had become known as the centre of Islam in the East. Kaki established Delhi as the main order of the Chishti Sufis. Since he used to hold musical evenings the ulemas in order to drive him out of Delhi brough the charge of heresy against him. But Iltutmish dismissed it as he wanted to use Kaki to counter the influence of the ulemas. '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 924, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 848})
