ld thus appear that Jainism was not much in favour during the time when the early Guptas occupied Northern India.” <br>“It transpires therefore that in the period of the early Guptas Jainism was also prevalent though not in a prosperous condition.”  “It would thus appear that Jainism was not much in favour during the time when the early Guptas occupied Northern India.” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 917, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 851})
