ic, Armenian and Georgian. There is  absolutely nothing like this in Charlemagne\'s world. The patristic period generated such robust theologizing that heresies popped up everywhere. The Carolingian period was almost astonishingly eirenic.”.'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 853, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 783})
