e popularity of the (eastern) mystery cults of Isis and Magna Mater (the Great Mother). These were cults into which one needed to be initiated, cults that were a form of personal religion (Burkert 1987: 12–29).” '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 891, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 810})
