ety. Nevertheless, attempts made by a number of mai in Bornu Empire resulted in influencing and spreading Islamic culture in the region." <br>"Clarke claims that this resulted from the increased number of Muslim scholars and their ascendance to key posts, which gave them political authority despite their small number compared with native religionists, who were unable to read or write." '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 879, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 800})
