ching into areas now deﬁned as South Africa, Zambia and Mozambique. Within that zone, there was a constant movement of people, goods, ideas, and a multitude of different self-identiﬁcations."'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 861, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 774})
