ce Manichaeans also suffered grievously in the purge. 29 Although Manichaeism was restored to an official status under the rulers Ay Tangrite ulug Bulmis Alp Kutlug Ulug Bilga Khagan/Huai-hsin (795- 808) and Ay Tangrite Kut Bulmis Alp Bilga Khagan/Pao-i (808- 821), it surely served as one of the ideologies of the leadership and not as a belief system that integrated secular and religious life for the peoples of the realm."\xa0'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 921, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 844})
